Source: vgadash
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Aditya Giri <aditya@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: vgadash-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Description: VGADASH kernel module packaged for DKMS
 VGADASH is an in-kernel VGA text dashboard for emergency observability.
 This package installs the module source into /usr/src so DKMS can rebuild
 and reinstall it automatically when kernels change.

Package: vgadash-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: helper commands for controlling the VGADASH dashboard
 This package installs vgadashctl, a small wrapper around the debugfs
 control plane used by the vgadash kernel module.
